It wasn't your job to
protect her, Brandt.


02:04:19.214 --> 02:04:21.423
It's mine.


02:04:27.608 --> 02:04:31.539
- So we're good?
- We're good.


02:05:52.900 --> 02:05:54.343
Good evening, Mr. Hunt.


02:05:54.378 --> 02:05:58.324
36 hours ago, there was a breach on
military's communication network.


02:05:58.359 --> 02:06:02.982
Now, an emerging terror organization
known as the Syndicate,


02:06:03.017 --> 02:06:04.323
has control over entire drone fleet.


02:06:04.358 --> 02:06:07.708
Your targets: unknown.


02:06:07.709 --> 02:06:11.058
Your mission, should you
choose to accept it...


